      "created_at": "2015-03-08T03:22:44.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So if some of you may or may not have heard. Blizzard, makers of Diablo, Starcraft and Warcraft is working on a first person shooter. The name of it is Overwatch.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now for Blizzard to do a new IP is cool. &nbsp;Its also just in Alpha/Beta so they're making things...things are in the works. &nbsp;Well today they just released gameplay footage of a new character.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kq4OlEDiCi8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kq4OlEDiCi8</a></p><p>Remind you of anyone you know?</p>",
