      "raw": "[quote=\"cmschex\"]\n\nUnless that cowboy travels through time i dont really see that being an issue...even then, comic tropes are not IP enforceable. &nbsp;I mean, much of the SotM lineup have clear homages to existing characters.\n\n[/quote]\n\nBut we are talking about a cowboy bounty hunter with the same hat, cigar problem, shoulder poncho, favors a pistol, uses grenades, and has a robotic left arm.\n\nThere is a big difference between playing with comic tropes and flat out copying characters. I&#39;m not saying that Blizzard is stealing Chrono Ranger here, but there is a lot more than just a passing resemblance there. Certainly calls it into question.\n\n[quote=\"McBehrer\"]\n\nAlso, Tracer is Tachyon, Hanzo is like Parse, and Widowmaker is like The Wraith.\n\n[/quote]\n\nThese are not even remotely close to the same ballpark as the Chrono similarities.\n",
