      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-10T21:40:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"lynkfox\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/48/1997_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> lynkfox:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>eh. That 'look' of the poncho, hat, cigar ect with 6 shooters is a classic Western Movie look. Its not unique to Chrono Ranger, its a pretty common trope.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It's not just little bits and pieces. It's the entire character's look and backstory and weaponry. The only difference between the two characters is time travel. Thats it.</p>\n<p>I'm not saying its a ripoff here, but it's a little more than sharing a few western tropes.</p>",
