      "username": "MightySi",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/{size}/2168_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-11T09:40:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The same could be said of other SOTM characters themselves tho... Child of millionaires has Tragic Event and fights crime from the shadows while running the Company during the day. &nbsp;Are we talking about Batman or Wraith? Or The Arrow? &nbsp;Or Mister Terrific?</p><p>Comics characters have a lot of overlap and the very comic-y style of Overwatch is bound to have a few similarities here and there.</p><p>Hell, wasn't Jonah Hex a horrifically scarred old west gunslinger who had a time-travel adventure or two a long time before Jim turned up? ;)</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
      "post_type": 1,
