      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-11T18:30:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And technology + cowboys comes up all the time. Sure maybe not the robotic arm, but tech+cowboy is a pretty big thing. And there is only so many backstories a cowboy type character can have.</p>\n<p>I get a much more Clint Eastwood meets tech vibe than chrono ranger. But I suppose it comes from what you have more familiarity with</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
