      "id": 136845,
      "name": "MarioFanaticXV",
      "username": "MarioFanaticXV",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-03-11T19:33:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Wraith is essentially female Batman- she even has Batarangs!<br><br>Omnitron X's appearance heavily draws from Mega Man X- right down to using the same font for their names (look at O-X's character card, then look at the title screen from the first Mega Man X game. Same exact font, no mistaking it was meant as an intentional allusion).<br><br>I don't know if Overwatch takes inspiration from Sentinels or not- but if it does, then just remember, all art is derivative. As long as no one is saying \"I'm the first one to ever have this concept.\" then those that inspired others should be honored, not offended.</p>",
      "post_number": 15,
